    "charter_id": "charter.mncds-promotion-integration",
    "problem_statement": "MNCDS owns obligation lifecycle semantics but ships no owner-native obligation-set evaluator, so repository-owned promotion cannot be decided from MNCDS evidence alone: open required obligations have no mechanism to hold a promotion boundary at UNKNOWN and authoritative rejections have no mechanism to hold it at FAIL.",
    "intended_use": "Give MNCDS an owner-native obligation evaluator implementing docs/mncds-check-catalog.md verbatim, and adopt the mncs-actions reusable promotion machinery from a repository-owned MNCDS boundary without moving semantic authority into transport.",
    "exclusions": [
      "No MNCS implementation-assurance claim is made.",
      "Organizational independence of review is not claimed; roster is OPEN.",
      "Transport-layer verdict semantics are out of scope for this episode."
    ],
